01:11.873 --> 01:15.007
Oh, oh, it's okay. I'm-I'm
talking about my own son.

01:16.743 --> 01:18.544
You know,
maybe I'll just avoid her.

01:18.546 --> 01:21.046
If I wanted to avoid every woman
I ever embarrassed myself

01:21.048 --> 01:22.915
