that you say them.

01:35.496 --> 01:36.896
No, no.

01:36.898 --> 01:39.164
It-It's also the things
that you do.

01:39.166 --> 01:41.300
Okay, you know,
I just wish there was a way

01:41.302 --> 01:42.668
