where, uh,

07:08.636 --> 07:12.238
I screw up relationships as soon
as they start going well.

07:12.240 --> 07:14.840
Oh. That's encouraging.

07:14.842 --> 07:16.842
Oh, oh. No, no, no.
But don't worry, uh,

07:16.844 --> 07:18.678
