I just...
I don't know what to do.

12:43.024 --> 12:46.225
It's like, Louis is stealing
your sausage and blocking mine.

12:46.227 --> 12:48.293
Well, sooner or later,
you just get over it.

12:48.295 --> 12:50.629
Uh, but in the meantime,
why don't you take her out

12:50.631 --> 12:52.364
for a romantic night to a hotel?

12:52.366 --> 12:55.000
Oh. I like that.

12:55.002 --> 12:57.136
Plus, people do all kinds
of things in hotels

12:57.138 --> 12:58.270
they don't do at home.

12:58.272 --> 13:01.006
Like pay eight dollars
for peanuts.

13:01.008 --> 13:04.209
I used to love
to have sex in hotel rooms.

13:04.211 --> 13:06.545
Then they caught me,
and they fired me.

13:09.148 --> 13:11.550
♪&lt;i> Men.&lt;/i> ♪

13:19.726 --> 13:22.127
Do you want to work in?

13:22.129 --> 13:23.328
What?

13:24.263 --> 13:25.964
Oh, oh, uh, work in, yeah.

13:25.966 --> 13:27.399
Uh, definitely want to work in.

13:27.401 --> 13:29.134
Why else would I be
sitting here?

13:29.136 --> 13:31.403
Thanks. (laughs)
No problem.

13:34.040 --> 13:36.274
Just, uh, show you
the proper technique.

13:36.276 --> 13:38.844
Mm.

13:38.846 --> 13:40.812
Here we go. (sighs)

13:40.814 --> 13:42.380
(laughs)

13:43.215 --> 13:45.550
(grunting)

13:46.953 --> 13:48.586
&lt;i>Aah!&lt;/i> Oh, aah.

13:48.588 --> 13:50.455
Bum shoulder. Yeah.

13:51.390 --> 13:53.625
Got it the last Iron Man.

13:53.627 --> 13:56.127
The movie, not the triathlon.

13:56.129 --> 13:58.596
I slipped in the lobby
on some artificial butter.

13:58.598 --> 13:59.731
Oh.

13:59.755 --> 14:01.809
There we go,
lighten the load, and, uh...

14:02.335 --> 14:03.768
One time, here we go.

14:03.770 --> 14:05.937
(laughs)

14:09.008 --> 14:11.442
(groaning)

14:11.444 --> 14:12.810
(passes gas)

14:12.812 --> 14:14.612
Oh, God!

14:17.416 --> 14:19.884
Nice meeting you!

14:20.719 --> 14:21.986
Hey, Alan.

14:21.988 --> 14:23.554
Oh. Oh, hey,
Lyndsey. Oh, hey.

14:23.556 --> 14:24.789
Yeah, I was just, uh...

14:24.791 --> 14:26.524
I was just doing the,
uh, the fly machine.

14:26.526 --> 14:28.526
You know, working out.

14:28.528 --> 14:30.228
You're really committing
to this workout thing.

14:30.230 --> 14:31.496
I'm impressed.

14:31.498 --> 14:34.065
I know. I haven't been anyplace
two days in a row

14:34.067 --> 14:36.100
since&lt;i> Jersey Boys&lt;/i> was touring.

14:36.102 --> 14:39.003
Where's Herb?
Uh, in the office.

14:39.005 --> 14:41.272
He got all excited about
an outbreak of pinkeye.

14:41.274 --> 14:43.908
When kids see pink,
Herb sees green.

14:43.910 --> 14:45.142
Well, tell him I said "hi."

14:45.144 --> 14:46.210
Oh, I don't know

14:46.212 --> 14:47.878
if that's such
a great idea.

14:47.880 --> 14:48.913
What do you mean?

14:48.915 --> 14:50.514
Well, get this.

14:50.516 --> 14:52.350
Uh, after we saw you
the other day,

14:52.352 --> 14:55.453
he wanted to know
if it was okay to ask you out.

14:55.455 --> 14:57.321
But don't worry. I told him no.

14:57.323 --> 14:59.790
What?

14:59.792 --> 15:02.193
You have no right
to decide who I go out with.

15:02.195 --> 15:04.161
Oh, come on, Lyndsey.
I mean, how would you feel

15:04.163 --> 15:06.430
if one of your friends wanted
to go out with me?

15:06.432 --> 15:10.668
Shocked, stunned,
like I need new friends.

15:10.670 --> 15:12.336
Look, I am just trying to help.

15:12.338 --> 15:13.571
You just got sober.

15:13.573 --> 15:15.406
I mean, before you move
onto somebody else,

15:15.408 --> 15:17.107
you should probably
get over your breakup

15:17.109 --> 15:18.475
with Captain Morgan.

15:18.477 --> 15:19.777
Are you freaking kidding me?!

15:19.779 --> 15:22.413
If I want to go out with Herb,
it is none of your business.

15:22.415 --> 15:24.748
In fact, nothing I do
is any of your business!

15:24.750 --> 15:26.884
Just stay the hell
out of my life!

15:30.121 --> 15:31.955
Roid rage.

15:31.957 --> 15:33.957
(laughs)

15:33.959 --> 15:36.126
Phew.

15:38.129 --> 15:40.197
♪&lt;i> Men.&lt;/i> ♪

15:40.199 --> 15:43.267
(laughing):
Okay.

15:43.269 --> 15:46.069
This was officially
a great idea.

15:46.071 --> 15:48.172
Did you like the way
I checked us in?

15:48.174 --> 15:50.807
Mr. and Mrs. R. Doinit?

15:50.809 --> 15:53.377
Um, I like to go
by my maiden name--

15:53.379 --> 15:55.045
Gettin' Some.

15:55.047 --> 15:57.214
Hey, check this out.

15:58.049 --> 15:59.616
(laughs)

15:59.618 --> 16:02.653
I just walked across the floor
without stepping on a Lego.

16:02.655 --> 16:04.020
(gasps)

16:04.022 --> 16:05.722
Look, there's chocolate
on the pillows,

16:05.724 --> 16:07.791
and it's not even in the shape
of a handprint.

16:07.793 --> 16:10.427
Oh. Get over here, woman.
Uh-uh.

16:10.429 --> 16:12.462
No, no. I've got
a surprise for you.

16:12.464 --> 16:13.864
A surprise?

16:13.866 --> 16:15.398
Mm-hmm.
Yay! What is it?

16:15.400 --> 16:16.867
Oh, I'll give you a hint.

16:16.869 --> 16:22.505
It's lacy, it's new, and you get
to bite the tags off.

16:22.507 --> 16:24.641
If it's big enough
to have tags on it,

16:24.643 --> 16:25.942
I already don't like it.

16:27.044 --> 16:29.679
♪&lt;i> Men.&lt;/i> ♪

16:29.681 --> 16:32.315
(doorbell ringing)

16:32.317 --> 16:35.518
Alan, what are you doing here?

16:35.520 --> 16:38.254
Well, I felt bad about earlier,
and I wanted to apologize.

16:38.256 --> 16:39.522
These are for you.

16:39.524 --> 16:41.691
For me, huh?

16:43.694 --> 16:46.429
"Mr. Schmidt, thank you so much
for your generous donation

16:46.431 --> 16:48.031
to the children's hospital."

16:48.033 --> 16:50.700
Um, I-I did not see that.

16:51.869 --> 16:53.803
HERB:
Is that the pizza guy?

16:57.908 --> 16:59.175
Herb?

16:59.177 --> 17:00.610
Alan, what are you doing here?

17:00.612 --> 17:03.746
What are you doing here, and...
and why are you wearing my robe?

17:03.748 --> 17:06.482
I'll let you guys talk.

17:06.484 --> 17:09.919
Alan, you showing up here
is the second best thing

17:09.921 --> 17:12.922
that's happened to me today.

17:14.892 --> 17:16.425
What the hell, Herb?

17:16.427 --> 17:19.095
Believe me, I had no intention
of going behind your back,

17:19.097 --> 17:21.497
but out of nowhere, Lyndsey
invited me over for dinner,

17:21.499 --> 17:23.266
and I thought,
"What's the harm?"

17:23.268 --> 17:24.734
Well, then, dinner
turned into dessert,

17:24.736 --> 17:28.938
and dessert turned into,
well, sex with Lyndsey.

17:28.940 --> 17:30.539
This hurts, Herb.

17:30.541 --> 17:32.208
Yesterday you were
tickling my prostate,

17:32.210 --> 17:34.276
and today you're
stabbing me in the back.

17:34.278 --> 17:35.711
Hey, it's your fault.

17:35.713 --> 17:37.012
You made me forbidden fruit.

17:37.014 --> 17:42.051
I was off-limits,
like dancing in&lt;i> Footloose.&lt;/i>

17:42.053 --> 17:44.186
Look, I'm sorry
it happened like this.

17:44.188 --> 17:46.622
And, well, if you want me
to stop seeing her,

17:46.624 --> 17:48.557
just say the word,
and it's over.

17:48.559 --> 17:49.792
LYNDSEY:
Herb?

17:49.794 --> 17:51.227
Well, you had your chance.

17:58.635 --> 18:01.070
What do you think?

18:01.072 --> 18:02.905
It's horrible. Take it off.

18:02.907 --> 18:04.240
(laughs)

18:05.041 --> 18:07.676
Oh!
Ooh!

18:09.312 --> 18:10.946
(phone chirps)

18:10.948 --> 18:13.215
No!
(laughs)

18:13.217 --> 18:14.616
It's okay. Get it.

18:14.618 --> 18:16.485
(sighs)

18:17.987 --> 18:19.688
Okay, babysitter wants to know

18:19.690 --> 18:21.883
if Lily can have ice cream
for dessert.

18:21.907 --> 18:22.692
(laughs)

18:22.693 --> 18:26.128
"Don't care. Getting laid."

18:26.130 --> 18:27.629
(mutters)

18:27.631 --> 18:29.164
No, I just wrote "Yes."

18:29.166 --> 18:30.599
(laughter)

18:30.601 --> 18:33.669
Oh, hey, you know, next time, we
should just get one babysitter,

18:33.671 --> 18:36.972
and then Louis can sleep
over with Lily at my house,

18:36.974 --> 18:40.042
and I can sleep over
with you at your house.

18:40.044 --> 18:42.210
Yeah, maybe.

18:43.212 --> 18:45.080
Wait, wait,
whoa, hold on.

18:45.082 --> 18:47.516
Do you not want there
to be a next time?

18:47.518 --> 18:49.785
I mean, please
reserve your judgment

18:49.787 --> 18:51.353
