first time.

18:51.355 --> 18:53.255
(laughs)
I rarely

18:53.257 --> 18:56.424
disappoint a woman sexually
before we have sex.

18:56.426 --> 19:00.662
No, it's just...
all kids have their differences.

19:00.664 --> 19:03.899
But I don't want to talk
about Louis and Lily right now.

19:03.901 --> 19:06.134
In fact, I don't want
to talk at all.

19:06.136 --> 19:08.970
I got better things
to do with my mouth.

19:10.239 --> 19:12.073
Wait a second.
Wait a second. Hold on.

19:12.075 --> 19:14.142
Wait. Louis and Lily
don't get along?

19:14.144 --> 19:15.443
Well, you know how kids are.

19:15.445 --> 19:17.579
One week, they like each other;
the next, they don't.

19:17.581 --> 19:19.647
So Louis doesn't like to share.

19:19.649 --> 19:21.383
Lucky for you, I do.

19:21.385 --> 19:23.718
Whoa, whoa,
whoa, whoa, whoa.

19:23.720 --> 19:25.420
Louis does not have
a problem sharing.

19:25.422 --> 19:29.190
In fact, I just talked to him
specifically about sharing.

19:29.192 --> 19:32.427
I'm sorry. Lily must
have made it up.

19:32.429 --> 19:34.829
That's probably it. Okay.

19:34.831 --> 19:36.431
Wait a second.

19:36.433 --> 19:39.200
So you're okay
with saying that Lily's a liar,

19:39.202 --> 19:41.169
but you can't admit
that Louis has issues?

19:41.171 --> 19:43.204
(laughs)
Oh. Okay, hold on.

19:43.206 --> 19:45.940
I think I would know
if my son has issues.

19:45.942 --> 19:47.342
Right, 'cause
you've been a parent

19:47.344 --> 19:48.676
for all of, what, two weeks?

19:48.678 --> 19:51.846
Two and a half.
(sighs)

19:51.848 --> 19:53.548
And fancy you
lecturing me.

19:53.550 --> 19:55.283
The mother of
Lily the biter.

19:55.285 --> 19:57.151
What? Lily's not a biter.

19:57.153 --> 19:59.821
All the other parents
call her "Lily-goat."

19:59.823 --> 20:02.390
You know what?
This was a bad idea.

20:02.392 --> 20:03.991
Oh, yeah, it was...

20:03.993 --> 20:06.360
(bleating):
baa-aa-aa-aa-aad.

20:06.362 --> 20:08.496
That was a sheep.

20:09.665 --> 20:12.099
And if this is how
you talk to women in bed,

20:12.101 --> 20:14.135
then no wonder
you had to marry Alan.

20:14.137 --> 20:17.605
(gasps) You will leave my husband
out of this!

20:17.607 --> 20:19.874
You don't even know
what you're missing.

20:19.876 --> 20:22.676
You were about to have
the hottest sex of your life!

20:22.678 --> 20:24.111
Oh, oh, easy for you to say

20:24.113 --> 20:25.913
since you don't have
to back it up.

20:25.915 --> 20:28.282
Oh, you want me to back it up?!
'Cause I'll back it up!

20:28.284 --> 20:30.284
Yeah, back it on up!

20:30.286 --> 20:31.585
Oh, what, are we gonna have sex?

20:31.587 --> 20:33.521
Shut up!
Oh...

20:33.523 --> 20:35.055
(yelps, chuckles)

20:35.057 --> 20:37.458
Okay, I see where Lily
gets her biting.

20:45.487 --> 20:47.021
♪&lt;i> Men.&lt;/i> ♪

20:47.023 --> 20:50.057
Boy, I was angrier
than I thought.

20:50.059 --> 20:51.726
(exhales)

20:51.728 --> 20:55.563
Boy, I was angrier
